\fs22
\b Functional Point Analysis (FPA)\b0\par
\b Mangrove Visualization System\b0\par
Project: nlplab/Prabu/mangroveviz\par
Date: March 30, 2026\par
Language: Python/Django\par
Analysis Basis: Current implemented features after user-role UI, vector CRUD, raster queue, dashboard, export, and AOI guidance improvements\par
\par
\b 1. Executive Summary\b0\par
\par
\b Project Overview\b0\par
Mangrove Viewer adalah aplikasi web GIS berbasis Django untuk visualisasi, analisis, dan manajemen data mangrove. Versi saat ini sudah mencakup autentikasi user, role viewer/editor/admin, UI assign role user, upload raster dengan validasi dan progress, queue sederhana untuk job raster berat, status polling, basemap switcher, klasifikasi klik peta, perhitungan luas raster dan ROI polygon, metadata raster, CRUD vektor, export data, dashboard statistik, dan audit trail.\par
\par
\b Current Size Metrics\b0\par
- Total Lines of Code: 1455 LOC Python\par
- Number of Python Files: 19\par
- Number of HTML Templates: 9\par
- Main Stack: Django, Django REST Framework, GeoDjango, Leaflet, GDAL, Docker, PostGIS\par
- Estimated Functional Size: 188 UFP\par
\par
