\par
\b 3. Functional Point Calculation\b0\par
UFP = EI 50 + EO 64 + EQ 17 + ILF 40 + EIF 17 = 188 FP\par
DI = 45\par
VAF = 0.65 + (0.01 x 45) = 1.10\par
AFP = 188 x 1.10 = 206.8\par
Rounded adjusted size: 207 FP\par
\par
\b 4. Productivity Analysis\b0\par
- LOC: 1455\par
- UFP: 188\par
- AFP: 207\par
- LOC per FP: 7.03 LOC/FP\par
- Estimated effort: about 23.0 person-months\par
- Project size classification: Medium-Large\par
